---
import Base from "../../layouts/Base.astro";
const title = "SEO Executive";
const description = "Crayonweb is seeking an SEO Executive to optimize websites, improve search rankings, and drive organic traffic for our digital projects.";
const canonical = "https://stage.woodwolfdigital.com/seo-executive/";
---
<Base title={title} description={description} canonical={canonical} type="website">
  <div class="container" style="padding:3rem 1rem">
    <h1>SEO Executive</h1>
    <p>Crayonweb is seeking an SEO Executive to optimize websites, improve search rankings, and drive organic traffic for our digital projects.</p>
    <h2>Job Details</h2>
    <ul><li>Vacancy: No of Vacancies: 01</li></ul>
<ul>
      <li>Location: Bhavnagar-Gujarat</li>
      <li>Date: 29 August 2025</li>
      <li>Job Type: Full Time (On Site)</li>
      <li>Working Hours: 10 AM to 07 PM</li>
      <li>Working Days: Weekly 6 days (Mon to Sat)</li>
      <li>Salary: As Per Eligibility</li>
    </ul>
    <h2>Drive Digital Growth with Us</h2>
    <p>CrayonWeb is seeking a skilled and motivated SEO Executive to join our digital team. In this role, you will be responsible for optimizing websites, improving search engine rankings, and driving organic traffic that delivers measurable business results. You will work closely with our content creators, developers, and marketing specialists to implement SEO strategies that align with client objectives and industry best practices. As an SEO Executive, you will conduct keyword research, on-page and off-page optimization, technical SEO audits, and performance tracking. You will stay updated with the latest search engine algorithms, trends, and tools to ensure our projects remain competitive and visible in search results. Your role will be crucial in enhancing user experience, increasing online visibility, and maximizing ROI for our clients. At CrayonWeb, we value innovation, collaboration, and growth. This position offers the opportunity to work on diverse projects across multiple industries, experiment with new SEO techniques, and sharpen your expertise in digital marketing. Our supportive work environment ensures your ideas are valued, your efforts recognized, and your career path nurtured.</p>
    <h2>requirements</h2>
    <p>Experience: At least 1 year</p>
    <h3>Additional Requirements</h3>
<h4>Technical &amp; SEO Skills</h4><ul><li>Strong knowledge of on-page and off-page SEO techniques</li><li>Proficiency with SEO tools such as Google Analytics, Google Search Console, SEMrush, Ahrefs, or Moz</li><li>Experience in keyword research, content optimization, and link-building strategies</li><li>Understanding of technical SEO: site structure, page speed, crawlability, and mobile optimization</li><li>Familiarity with CMS platforms (WordPress, TYPO3, or similar)</li></ul>
    <h4>Analytical &amp; Reporting Skills</h4><ul><li>Ability to track, analyze, and report SEO performance metrics</li><li>Competence in conducting competitor analysis and market research</li><li>Data-driven mindset to optimize strategies and improve ROI</li><li>Knowledge of SEO trends, search engine algorithm updates, and best practices</li></ul>
    <h4>Preferred Experience (a plus)</h4><ul><li>Experience in local SEO, eCommerce SEO, or international SEO campaigns</li><li>Basic understanding of HTML, CSS, and website structure</li><li>Strong communication skills to coordinate with content creators and development teams</li></ul>
    <h4>Soft Skills</h4><ul><li>Analytical Thinking: Ability to interpret data and make informed decisions.</li><li>Attention to Detail: Ensuring all on-page elements, keywords, and SEO tasks are precise.</li><li>Communication Skills: Clearly explaining SEO strategies and collaborating with content and development teams.</li><li>Problem-Solving: Identifying SEO issues and finding creative, effective solutions.</li><li>Time Management: Handling multiple projects and meeting deadlines efficiently.</li><li>Adaptability: Staying updated with changing search engine algorithms and trends.</li><li>Teamwork: Collaborating with marketing, content, and web development teams.</li><li>Creativity: Suggesting innovative strategies to improve organic visibility.</li></ul>
    <h2>Email your CV</h2>
    <p>Send your CV to the given email <a href="mailto:hr@crayonwebstudio.com">hr@crayonwebstudio.com</a></p>
    <h2>Apply Position</h2>
<form>
      <p><label>Your first name<br /><input type="text" name="first_name" /></label></p>
      <p><label>Your last name<br /><input type="text" name="last_name" /></label></p>
      <p><label>Your email address *<br /><input type="email" name="email" required /></label></p>
      <p><label>Your phone number *<br /><input type="tel" name="phone" required /></label></p>
      <p><label>Working Experience *<br /><input type="text" name="experience" required /></label></p>
      <p><label>Upload CV *<br /><input type="file" name="cv" required /></label></p>
      <p><label>Your message<br /><textarea name="message" rows="5"></textarea></label></p>
      <p><button type="submit">Submit</button></p>
    </form>
    <p>Note: this form is front end only on this staging site, so nothing is sent. Email your CV to <a href="mailto:hr@crayonwebstudio.com">hr@crayonwebstudio.com</a> instead.</p>
  </div>
</Base>
